ounded Lesson use."}],"noNewGrammarReason":"Lexical-focus Lesson using familiar A1 sentence patterns; no new grammar is claimed."},"pedagogyVersion":2},"pilot":false,"audioRequired":true,"humanEnglishAuditRequired":true,"dialogueRuntime":"guided_exchange","qualityStage":"model_reviewed_for_testing","qualityV2Remediated":true,"qualityV2RemediationVersion":1}')
